  "notes": "PRONUNCIATION: なん vs なに\n- なん: Before た/だ/な row sounds and counters\n- なに: Before other sounds, or standalone\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {何|なん}{時|じ} (what time)\n- {何|なん}{曜日|ようび} (what day of the week)\n- {何|なん}{人|にん} (how many people)\n- {何|なん}{個|こ} (how many items)\n- {何|なん}{歳|さい} (how old)\n- {何|なん}{月|がつ} (what month)\n- {何|なん}{日|にち} (what day of the month)\n- {何|なん}{番|ばん} (what number)\n\nALSO:\n- {何|なん}で (why; by what means)\n- {何|なん}でも (anything, whatever)\n- {何|なん}とか (somehow, something or other)",
